      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Wasn't my mother's death just a car accident?",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:b9v4z2r8",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "I need to go investigate my stepmother's room.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:b9v4z2r8",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "I remember her room...",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:b9v4z2r8",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "I'm sorry, Miss Scarlett. No one is allowed near her when Mrs. Vivian not home.",
      "characterName": "Head Maid",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "I'm a member of the Harrington family. I don't think I'm \"just anyone.\"",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:b9v4z2r8",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "I'm sorry, please leave.",
      "characterName": "Head Maid",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "She's definitely going to report my actions to Vivian. Maybe I should come back at another time.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:b9v4z2r8",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
